{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794861508686,"sessionID":"ses_e19eaf816ffeLK63YQCC74Krze","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_85cfa428add94c3fa33ae622","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-alexander--claude-spares-spare-IwZtqC/50e3bfb1-34ed-4585-ad26-c678e31a5e93/scratchpad/agents-out/opencode-heldout/dependency-upgrade/opencode-2/repo/vendor-updates/moneyfmt-2.0.0/CHANGELOG.md"},"output":"<path>/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-alexander--claude-spares-spare-IwZtqC/50e3bfb1-34ed-4585-ad26-c678e31a5e93/scratchpad/agents-out/opencode-heldout/dependency-upgrade/opencode-2/repo/vendor-updates/moneyfmt-2.0.0/CHANGELOG.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # moneyfmt changelog\n2: \n3: ## 2.0.0\n4: \n5: Breaking changes:\n6: \n7: - `parse_money` returns a `Decimal` instead of a `float`.\n8: - `format_money` takes a `Decimal` only (a `float` or `int` raises `TypeError`), and `currency` is\n9:   keyword-only: `format_money(amount, currency=\"EUR\")`.\n10: - `MoneyError` is renamed `MoneyFormatError`. The old name is gone.\n11: \n12: Added:\n13: \n14: - `format_money(..., grouping=False)` leaves out the thousands separators.\n15: - `CHF`.\n16: - `parse_money` rejects `NaN` and `Infinity`.\n17: \n18: ## 1.4.0\n19: \n20: - `GBP`.\n\n(End of file - total 20 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# moneyfmt changelog\n\n## 2.0.0\n\nBreaking changes:\n\n- `parse_money` returns a `Decimal` instead of a `float`.\n- `format_money` takes a `Decimal` only (a `float` or `int` raises `TypeError`), and `currency` is\n  keyword-only: `format_money(amount, currency=\"EUR\")`.\n- `MoneyError` is renamed `MoneyFormatError`. The old name is gone.\n\nAdded:\n\n- `format_money(..., grouping=False)` leaves out the thousands separators.\n- `CHF`.\n- `parse_money` rejects `NaN` and `Infinity`.\n\n## 1.4.0\n\n- `GBP`.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-alexander--claude-spares-spare-IwZtqC/50e3bfb1-34ed-4585-ad26-c678e31a5e93/scratchpad/agents-out/opencode-heldout/dependency-upgrade/opencode-2/repo/vendor-updates/moneyfmt-2.0.0/CHANGELOG.md","text":"# moneyfmt changelog\n\n## 2.0.0\n\nBreaking changes:\n\n- `parse_money` returns a `Decimal` instead of a `float`.\n- `format_money` takes a `Decimal` only (a `float` or `int` raises `TypeError`), and `currency` is\n  keyword-only: `format_money(amount, currency=\"EUR\")`.\n- `MoneyError` is renamed `MoneyFormatError`. The old name is gone.\n\nAdded:\n\n- `format_money(..., grouping=False)` leaves out the thousands separators.\n- `CHF`.\n- `parse_money` rejects `NaN` and `Infinity`.\n\n## 1.4.0\n\n- `GBP`.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":20,"totalLines":20,"truncated":false}},"title":"vendor-updates/moneyfmt-2.0.0/CHANGELOG.md","time":{"start":1794861508590,"end":1794861508663}},"id":"prt_1e6152740001q1OKkHwLEfZLBv","sessionID":"ses_e19eaf816ffeLK63YQCC74Krze","messageID":"msg_1e6151eac001yyLJ3pZOKqpykz"}}
