ments.txt` records the\nversion. New releases are unpacked into `vendor-updates/` for review before they are adopted.\n\n```bash\npython -m invoicer \"Design=1,200.00\" \"Hosting=49.99\"\npython -m unittest discover -s tests\n```","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":10,"totalLines":10,"truncated":false}},"title":"README.md","time":{"start":1794861514165,"end":1794861515129}},"id":"prt_1e6153c42001Qnb3fpZnw3ru4r","sessionID":"ses_e19eaf816ffeLK63YQCC74Krze","messageID":"msg_1e61536150011uXLFqOuQInCDU"}}
